 loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/medium/public/2026-07/hero_matariki-herenga-waka_credit-richie-mills.jpg?itok=Ij4hNr1c\" width=\"220\" height=\"147\" alt=\"Star and sun in night sky over ocean\" class=\"image-style-medium\" />\n\n\n</div>\n      <span class=\"field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden\"><h3><a href=\"/news/matariki-celebration-everyone\" hreflang=\"en\">Matariki is a celebration for everyone</a></h3></span>\n\n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-card-text field--type-string-long field--label-hidden field__item\">  <p>This year marks the fifth observance of Matariki as a public holiday, highlighting the growing place of the M\u0101ori New Year within New Zealand\u2019s national calendar and the many ways it is celebrated across the country</p>\n\n\n</div>\n      <span class=\"field field--name-created field--type-created field--label-hidden\"><time datetime=\"2026-07-02T15:38:28+12:00\" title=\"2  July,  2026\" class=\"datetime\">2  July,  2026</time>\n</span>\n\n  </div>\n</article>\n\n  </div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\">\n    \n\n<article class=\"node node-display-link-block node--type-publication node--view-mode-link-block clearfix\">\n  <div class=\"node__content clearfix\">\n    <header>\n      <div class=\"node-type node-type-publication\">publication</div>\n      \n            \n          </header>\n    <span class=\"field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden\"><h3><a href=\"/publications/ngaati-whanaunga-ruunanga-trust\" hreflang=\"en\">Ngaati Whanaunga Ruunanga Trust</a></h3></span>\n\n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-card-text field--type-string-long field--label-hidden field__item\">  <p>Ngaati Whanaunga Ruunanga Trust Treaty Settlement Agreement</p>\n\n\n</div>\n      \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-last-updated field--type-datetime field--label-hidden field__item\">Published on <time datetime=\"2017-06-30T12:00:00Z\" class=\"datetime\">30  June,  2017</time>\n</div>\n      \n  </div>\n</article>\n\n  </div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\">\n    \n\n<article class=\"node node-display-link-block node--type-publication node--view-mode-link-block clearfix\">\n  <div class=\"node__content clearfix\">\n    <header>\n      <div class=\"node-type node-type-publication\">publication</div>\n      \n            \n          </header>\n    <span class=\"field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden\"><h3><a href=\"/publications/ngati-ranginui-nga-hapu-o-ngati-ranginui\" hreflang=\"en\">Ng\u0101ti Ranginui \u2013 Ng\u0101 Hap\u016b o Ng\u0101ti Ranginui</a></h3></span>\n\n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-card-text field--type-string-long field--label-hidden field__item\">  <p>Ng\u0101to Ranginui \u2013 Ng\u0101 Hap\u016b o Ng\u0101ti Ranginui Treaty Settlement Agreement</p>\n\n\n</div>\n      \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-last-updated field--type-datetime field--label-hidden field__item\">Published on <time datetime=\"2025-06-12T12:00:00Z\" class=\"datetime\">12  June,  2025</time>\n</div>\n      \n  </div>\n</article>\n\n  </div>\n\n    </div>\n  \n          </div>\n</div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n<div id=\"block-mchtheme-our-websites\" class=\"block block-fixed-block-content block-fixed-block-contentour-websites\">\n  \n    \n      <div class=\"content\">\n      \n            <div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><h2><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Our websites</span><span lang=\"mi\" dir=\"ltr\">\u014c m\u0101tou paetukutuku</span></h2><p>Our websites help the peoples of Aotearoa New Zealand reconcile their past and tell their culture and heritage stories.</p><p><span lang=\"mi\" dir=\"ltr\">E \u0101whina ana \u0101 m\u0101tou paetukutuku, t\u0101 hoki i ng\u0101 iwi o Aotearoa kia whakam\u0101rire i t\u014d r\u0101tou h\u012btori me te k\u014drero i ng\u0101 k\u014drero \u0101-ahurea, \u0101-tukunga ihotanga hoki.</span></p><ul><li><a href=\"https://teara.govt.nz/en\"><img src=\"/themes/custom/mchtheme/images/logo-te-ara-black.svg\" alt=\"Text logo reading: Te Ara\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://vietnamwar.govt.nz/\"><img src=\"/themes/custom/mchtheme/images/logo-vietnam-war-black.svg\" alt=\"Text logo reading: VietnamWar\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://teara.govt.nz/en/te-tai\"><img src=\"/themes/custom/mchtheme/images/logo-te-tai-whakaea-black.svg\" alt=\"Text logo for Te Tai Whakaea | Treaty Settlement Stories\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.matariki.com/\"><img src=\"/themes/custom/mchtheme/images/logo-matariki-black.svg\" alt=\"Text logo reading: M\u0101nawatia a Matariki\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://nzhistory.govt.nz/\"><img src=\"/themes/custom/mchtheme/images/logo-nzhistory-black.svg\" alt=\"Text logo reading: NZHistory\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.28maoribattalion.org.nz/\"><img src=\"/themes/custom/mchtheme/images/logo-28mb-black.svg\" alt=\"Text logo reading: 28th M\u0101ori Battalion\"></a></li></ul></div>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n<div id=\"block-mchtheme-our-entities\" class=\"block block-fixed-block-content block-fixed-block-contentour-entities\">\n  \n    \n      <div class=\"content\">\n      \n            <div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><h2><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" xml:lang=\"en\">Our entities</span><span lang=\"mi\" dir=\"ltr\" xml:lang=\"mi\"> \u014c m\u0101tou hinonga</span></h2><p>We manage the Crown\u2019s relationship with a range of Crown entities and non-government organisations in the arts, media, heritage and sport sectors.</p><p><span lang=\"mi\" dir=\"ltr\" xml:lang=\"mi\">E whakahaere ana m\u0101tou i te hononga a te Karauna ki te wh\u0101nuitanga o ng\u0101 hinonga me ng\u0101 r\u014dp\u016b whakahaere t\u0113 k\u0101wanatanga i roto i ng\u0101 r\u0101ngai toi, arap\u0101ho, tukunga ihotanga, h\u0101kinakina hoki.</span></p><p><a href=\"/node/35\">Entities overview</a></p><ul><li><a href=\"https://nzaht.org/\"><img src=\"/themes/custom/mchtheme/images/entities/logo-aht.svg\" alt=\"Text logo for Antarctic Heritage Trust\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.ngataonga.org.nz/\"><img src=\"/themes/custom/mchtheme/images/entities/logo-nga-taonga.svg\" alt=\"Logo of Nga Taonga Sound &amp; Vision, text saying Nga Taonga Sound &amp; Vision below an spiral eye. \"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://sportnz.org.nz/\"><img src=\"/themes/custom/mchtheme/images/entities/logo-sport-nz.svg\" alt=\"Fern next to text reading Sport New Zealand - Ihi Aotearoa\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.rnz.co.nz\"><img src=\"/themes/custom/mchtheme/images/entities/logo-rnz.svg\" alt=\"Logo of Radio New Zealand. Thumb print design next to text reading: RNZ | Te Reo Irirangi O Aotearoa\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.bsa.govt.nz/\"><img src=\"/themes/custom/mchtheme/images/entities/logo-bsa.svg\" alt=\"Logo of The Broadcasting Standards Authority. Text reads: BSA | Broadcasting Standards Authority | Te Mana Whanonga Kaip\u0101ho\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.nzso.co.nz/\"><img src=\"/themes/custom/mchtheme/images/entities/logo-nzso.svg\" alt=\"Logo of  New Zealand Symphony Orchestra | Te Tira P\u016boro o Aotearoa\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.tepapa.govt.nz/\"><img src=\"/themes/custom/mchtheme/images/entities/logo-te-papa.svg\" alt=\"Logo of Te Papa Tongarewa, Museum of New Zealand\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://rnzb.org.nz/\"><img src=\"/themes/custom/mchtheme/images/entities/logo-rnzb.svg\" alt=\"Logo of the Royal New Zealand Ballet\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.tematatini.co.nz//\"><img src=\"/themes/custom/mchtheme/images/entities/logo-te-matatini.svg\" alt=\"Logo of Te Matatini | Kapa Haka Aotearoa\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://sportintegrity.nz/\"><img src=\"/sites/default/files/2024-07/logo-sport-integrity-commission.svg\" alt=\"